                3D4E is a multi-collegiate organization of students interested in 3D printing and its applications.
              </p>
              <p>
                We provide 3D printing expertise & engineering resources to all UCLA and her surrounding community.
                We also enable you to bring your transformative ideas to life, with a little elbow grease and a helping hand!
                We pride ourselves on our openness, our response times, our material selections,
                and our printer infrastructure to make sure the only question you have about your projects will be how soon can I get it. 
              </p>
