                  <li>offer workshops on 3D modeling/printing software and skills</li>
                  <li>host social events to encourage bonding and teamwork</li>
                  <li>organize outreach events for local middle- and high-school students</li>
                  <li>connect with companies and alumni to bring opportunities to students</li>
                </ul>
              </p>
